== Biography
I am currently a researcher at Noah’s Ark Lab, Huawei Hong Kong Research Center. I received my Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering from The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK) in July 2025, where I was advised by [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~byu/ Prof. Bei Yu] and [https://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/people/faculty/tsung-yi-ho/ Prof. Tsung-Yi Ho]. Earlier, I received my bachelor's degrees in IoT Engineering and Applied Mathematics from the University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC) in 2020.

== Research Interests
- LLM for Chip Design
- AI for verification
- Hardware–Software Co-design

== Publication
- \[C1\] Jiahao Liu, Zhen Zhu, Yong Zhou, Ning Wang, Guanghai Dai, Qingsong Liu, Jianbiao Xiao, Yuxiang Xie, Zirui Zhong, *Hongduo Liu*, Liang Chang, Jun Zhou,
 “BioAIP: A Reconfigurable Biomedical AI Processor with Adaptive Learning for Versatile Intelligent Health Monitoring”, 2021 IEEE International Solid-State Circuits Conference (ISSCC), Feb. 13–22, 2021.

